      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has gotten worse with the last update, this has always been an issue for me and my avatars, it used to only affect material toggles, but now it affects gameobjects too, be it clothes, particles etc.\n\nThis happens when my avis bool toggles are set to the non default state on avatar load.\n\nSo Material Swap is On(Off is default), if I try to toggle it off now to its default state(off), the mirror clone will simply not do it and remain in the on state.\n\nThe Avatar itself will do it, the mirror clone however wont.\n\nCan we just get rid of mirror clones already?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
