  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "\"for performance reasons the mirrorreflection copy of your avatar is now disabled when you are not looking at any mirrors\"\n\nIn situations where an avatar has an animation that always plays when the avatar is loaded, that animation will play in the mirror when the mirror is placed for the first time in a world, even if the avatar has already been loaded minutes ago. Essentially the mirror is desynced from what the player's avatar actually looks like.\n\nMy avatar avtr_89fd6f71-16f4-4dbf-a9ea-1d9b44da8e54 has an animation that plays by default when the avatar is loaded (see attached image), this is a dumb workaround to fix an issue with some of the materials.\n\nIn beta when you load in to a world and place a mirror, that animation will play in the mirror: \n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=48GlM4pXkmE",
